  "title": {
   "en": "Dig or Die"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "삽가능"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I logged into the hottest new VR game— and got handed… a shovel? Not a sword. Not magic. Just… a shovel. Apparently, it can build anything—walls, weapons, traps— but there’s a catch: every monster in the game targets only me. So what do I do? I dig, I build, and when they come at me… I smash everything with my shovel! But now, some strange folks have shown up, drawn by the chaos I’ve caused with my one-of-a-kind weapon. It’s me and my shovel vs the whole world. Bring it on."
  },
